description = "Give me a reason to kill - a good reason.\n\n[PAWN_nameDef] was a soldier and a skilled one - so skilled that [PAWN_pronoun] entered the special forces to battle militants and xenohuman raiders. [PAWN_pronoun] never imagined [PAWN_objective]self as lone hero, but [PAWN_pronoun] played [PAWN_possessive] part in the group well."
